@startuml sequence-landing-page
title Sequence — Landing Page Initial Render (current)

actor User as u
participant "Browser\n(SPA)" as b
note over b: Static React bundle.\nNo backend call on the landing path.

u -> b: Navigate to site
b -> b: Bootstrap React, render <LandingPage />
b -> b: import landingContent from "./landingContent"\n(bundled at build time)
b -> b: themeVars memo →\n--brand-* CSS vars applied\nfrom landingContent.color_palette
b -> u: Render hero, features, stats, quote form
@enduml
